      "label": "Stereotypical Juxtaposition Scene",
      "description": "The scene presents a visual and textual juxtaposition that reinforces a harmful stereotype. The image of the man (a visual representation of a 'foreigner' in the meme's context) is paired with text that implies gay men are 'stoned' by foreigners, creating a scene of hateful stereotyping. The man is positioned centrally in the image, and the text is layered above and below him, framing him as the subject of the stereotype.",
