      "label": "Islamophobia Stereotype",
      "description": "The meme implicitly relies on the stereotype that Muslims are associated with terrorism or barbarism, by using the image of a man wearing a kufi (a traditional Islamic head covering) to represent a 'foreigner'. This visual choice reinforces the harmful stereotype that Muslims are inherently threatening or 'stoned' (i.e., unwelcome or dangerous) to gay men, which is a form of Islamophobia.",
