      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "intended audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed for an audience that may be familiar with or perpetuates harmful stereotypes about LGBTQ+ individuals and Muslims, particularly those who might find humor in or be receptive to derogatory generalizations. The target audience likely includes individuals who are not directly targeted by the stereotype but who may consume and share such content due to its virality or perceived 'joke' value, often without recognizing the hateful nature of the content. The meme relies on the audience's understanding of the visual cue (man in kufi = foreigner) and the textual punchline to reinforce its harmful message, suggesting the audience is expected to interpret the image and text through the lens of these stereotypes.",
